igtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","review_id":"A-T1rFx2liK8gpuQumWGkQ","date":"2017-03-24T13:53:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9523589015007019,"text_excerpt":"This is a great place. Super friendly staff, old school India decor, great food.... I'm a little biased due to multiple visits this year, but I wouldn't say it if it wasn't true. There is a buffet a couple of times a week. Great chicken and vegetarian dishes. Spicy, flavorful and delicious. The basmati rice is even perfect. Saag Paneer (Curried spinach with farmers cheese). The cheese is so mild, I thought it was tofu. Butter chicken ( roasted pieces of tender chicken cooked in a tomato butter methi sauce)is a bit spicy and delicious. Vegetable soup is great. Plentiful Naan. I recommend Nirvana for a delicious lunch or dinner. Come for the food, talk to the staff, and chefs. They're a lot..."},{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","review_id":"jXLWvW0xwJi8TQa98R3ezQ","date":"2011-04-24T15:30:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9467491507530212,"text_excerpt":"I could eat Indian food all week long if I lived next to Nirvanas. I dined in several times over the last year and always had a great experience. The service has always been good and the food has always been delicious. Their Chicken Tikka Masala and their Lamb Achari are two of my favorites. I never got the opportunity to do lunch here, but they advertise a very affordable buffet that I wish I could have tried."},{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","review_id":"RSkGqbJt9lCHedVMje_G0w","date":"2017-06-06T19:51:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9448851346969604,"text_excerpt":"My co-worker and I went to NIrvana for lunch today. I heard before that Nirvana is heavy on dairy for their curry and for that reason, I took a look at the buffet section first before deciding whether to go with Buffet or the regular dish off of menu. Everything except one (Yellow lentil) had dairy in it. I did not even ask but the server told the cook about it and they fixed me non-diary version of one of the curry that was out! Really amazingly so nice of the cook. He brought out like a regular dish and the portion was generous. Charged us only for 2 buffet. My coworker tried all the curries and he liked it. I liked what I had too. Very nice and ample sitting area and I think this place..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","photo_id":"8hOnEmXI8n1IBjF9lPuFsw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8hOnEmXI8n1IBjF9lPuFsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8447761535644531},{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","photo_id":"Ud7u32CPYMRQF7KEeVuYcg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Ud7u32CPYMRQF7KEeVuYcg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.814410924911499},{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","photo_id":"oYa1wQ7B4XAQBm2FDo-LYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/oYa1wQ7B4XAQBm2FDo-LYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8116092085838318},{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","photo_id":"yaxtopYhcsgrb2kyj4op_Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yaxtopYhcsgrb2kyj4op_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8056398630142212},{"business_id":"zYyVEC0IF86xSHF3GFmvkg","photo_id":"HHpm0oZZBN6VXceKVyE9sg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/HHpm0oZZBN6VXceKVyE9sg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7575039863586426}]},"notebook_case":null}
